<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Plate Glass half year earnings fall.</title>
<headline>Plate Glass half year earnings fall.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended September 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     316.4	 vs 332.8</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 149.0	 vs 149.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   124.8	 vs 128.6</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   246.4	 vs 178.8</p>
<p>    Tax			 58.2	  vs 41.6</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   35.1	  vs 18.9</p>
<p>    Turnover		  3,340.9     vs 2,124.7</p>
<p>Div payable December 31</p>
<p>on register November 22</p>
<p>Full name: Plate Glass and Shatterprufe Industries Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it would offer capitalisation shares in lieu of the cash dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
